{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/7367","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/7367/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/7367/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/7367/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/7367","id":137762189,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMzc3NjIxODk=","number":7367,"title":"Router: link urls doesn't have query string parameters","user":{"login":"alexpods","id":4254276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTQyNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4254276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods","html_url":"https://github.com/alexpods","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexpods/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2016-03-02T03:35:46Z","updated_at":"2019-09-08T03:21:19Z","closed_at":"2016-03-10T00:21:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Copy of @zanettin's issue from https://github.com/angular/router/issues/397\n\nWhen I click on a routerLink\n\n**LINK**:\n\n``` html\n<a [routerLink]=\" ['./RouteParamsTest', { userId : '1919', lang : 'it', token : 'jwt' }] \">Route Params Test 2</a>\n```\n\n**CONFIG**:\n\n``` js\n{ path: '/route-params-test/:userId/:lang', component: RouteParamsTest, name: 'RouteParamsTest' }\n```\n\nwith disabled JS, this URL gets called => http://localhost:3000/route-params-test/1919/it and the query string won't appear. With activated JS everything works as expected.\n\nThe reason of the problem is [here](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/modules/angular2/src/router/instruction.ts#L162). As you can see `urlParams` are used only in `_stringifyMatrixParams()` which is called only if we have `auxInstructions` (see [here](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/modules/angular2/src/router/instruction.ts#L198)). So if we don't have auxilary routes then `urlParams` will never be used. (`toLinkUrl()` is called [here](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/modules/angular2/src/router/directives/router_link.ts#L65) to update `href` of the link)\n\n@matsko @btford @IgorMinar \n","closed_by":{"login":"alexeagle","id":47395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3Mzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexeagle","html_url":"https://github.com/alexeagle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexeagle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexeagle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexeagle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexeagle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexeagle/subscriptions","organizations_url"